WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:04,850
Uncle, help me shout something with a loudspeaker.

2
00:00:05,290 --> 00:00:06,210
My house is built

3
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:08,010
Anyone who is willing to work in the village can come.

4
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:09,840
Two dollars a day

5
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:12,360
Enough to pipe meat and tobacco at noon

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,320
Two yuan a day

7
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:21,900
Every penny means longevity

8
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,980
I felt wronged for letting you live in a shabby house with me before.

9
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:31,220
This time I will build a decent home for you and Niuniu.

10
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:40,390
The house construction just started

11
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:41,470
You are going into the mountains again

12
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:44,440
The village chief is keeping an eye on me at home

13
00:00:45,570 --> 00:00:46,810
I have to go see my mountain
